    "raw_output": "```python\nfrom typing import Optional\n\ndef bounded_prefix_sum(values: list[int], bound: int) -> Optional[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculate the bounded prefix sum.\n    \n    Returns the exact sum only when every prefix sum, including the initial zero,\n    remains within the inclusive symmetric bound.\n    Rejects a negative bound and returns None on arithmetic overflow.\n    \n    Args:\n        values: List of integers.\n        bound: The symmetric bound. Must be non-negative.\n    \n    Returns:\n        The exact sum if all prefix sums are within [-bound, bound], otherwise None.\n    \"\"\"\n    if bound < 0:\n        return None\n    \n    current_sum = 0\n    for value in values:\n        current_sum += value\n        if current_sum < -bound or current_sum > bound:\n            return None\n    \n    return current_sum\n```<|im_end|>",
